  "description": "Visual Genome v1. Ten stable themes map to distinct CPU scene families and bounded growth profiles. Motion modes specify reduced, low-power, balanced and cinematic budgets. CI generates typed CPU contracts from the manifest; the boot renderer does not parse JSON at runtime. Validation tools read this manifest directly; desktop GPU and host integration remain separate milestones.",
